# Nameless line worker. Short lore, the EBI open-carry rule.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: You're not on my shift roster.
#
o_text: Why are there so many guards?
o_id: worker_guards
o_goto: Guards
#
o_text: Sorry. Wrong door.
o_id: worker_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Guards
npc: Somebody walked in with a rifle on his back last year and walked out with a cold unit. Now anyone carrying open gets shot first and asked later. Keep it under your coat, friend.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Then find the right one.
effect: EndConversation
